# Hog-Monkey: "target creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it". Bot1 controls the Monkey (no counter) and a Grizzly Bears given a
# counter by its own Snakeskin Veil; Bot2 controls a Grizzly Bears with a counter of its own. At the turn-3 combat the trigger asks for no
# target, because only Bot1's Bears is one (the Monkey has no counter; the other side's Bears is not "you control"): the Bears gain menace,
# the Monkey and Bot2's Bears do not.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Hog-Monkey
Grizzly Bears
Snakeskin Veil
Swamp x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Gleemox
Grizzly Bears
Snakeskin Veil
Swamp x15

